[node name="Sources" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Center/Card/Margin/Credits"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(0, 212)
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]OuterBase team[/b]
Built for NASA Space Apps.

[b]Space weather[/b]
[url=https://ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/DONKI/events/]NASA CCMC DONKI[/url] · Solar flares and energetic particles.
[url=https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/stp/space-weather/interplanetary-data/solar-proton-events/archive/SEP%20page%20code.20241115.html]NOAA SWPC archive[/url] · Proton storm records.
The game replays historical events from October 2024. Radiation dose and equipment failures are simulated.

[b]Life on the space station[/b]
[url=https://www.nasa.gov/missions/station/iss-research/astronaut-exercise/]NASA Astronaut Exercise[/url]
[url=https://osdr.nasa.gov/bio/repo/data/studies/OSD-684]NASA OSDR · OSD-684[/url]
[url=https://www.nasa.gov/missions/station/iss-research/nasa-achieves-water-recovery-milestone-on-international-space-station/]NASA · Water recovery[/url]

[b]AI-assisted work[/b]
OpenAI Codex · Implementation and testing
Google Antigravity · Implementation
ChatGPT · Contribution to confirm
Solar panels (SolarArray.gd) · [b]AI-generated[/b]
Added wall faces and trim (ExteriorPerimeter.gd) · [b]AI-generated[/b]"

